@name     channel_pair
@alias    cp
@group    voice
@c_name   skode_clause_channel_pair
@type     realtime
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  select stereo channel pair from multi-channel wave
@doc
Selects which stereo channel pair this voice plays from a multi-channel wave (0 = ch 0/1, 1 = ch 2/3, etc.).
Usage: cp pair (or channel_pair pair)
@code
    if (voice < 0 || voice >= synth_config.voice_max) return -1;
    int pair = (int)args[0];
    return voice_channel_pair_set(voice, pair);
@end
